# Copy values into Render dashboards (do not commit real secrets here).
#
# ── Static Site (frontend) → Environment ─────────────────────────────────────
# Build-time only — redeploy after changing.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://YOUR-API-SERVICE.onrender.com/api/v1
#
# ── Web Service (backend) → Environment ────────────────────────────────────────
# Replace YOUR-FRONTEND with the static site URL (no trailing slash).
CORS_ORIGINS=https://YOUR-FRONTEND.onrender.com
APP_BASE_URL=https://YOUR-FRONTEND.onrender.com
TRUST_PROXY_HOPS=1
#
# Keep your existing production API vars (MONGODB_URI, SESSION_SECRET, NODE_ENV=production, …).
#
# Backend Web Service (Root Directory: backend)
#   Build:  npm install && npm run build
#   Start:  npm start
# If build still skips dev tools, use: npm install --include=dev && npm run build
